*ShipmentController.kt** — Added `confirm()` method that:\n   - Returns 404 if shipment not found (ResourceNotFoundException)\n   - Returns 409 if shipment is CANCELLED (ConflictException with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE)\n   - Transitions CREATED→CONFIRMED by creating new Shipment with copy()\n   - Returns unchanged shipment if already CONFIRMED (idempotent)\n   - Follows the same exception-throwing pattern as other endpoints\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added four tests:\n   - CREATED→CONFIRMED transition \n   - Idempotent retry on already CONFIRMED\n   - 409 Conflict for CANCELLED state\n   - 404 Not Found for missing shipment\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria are met.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add a POST endpoint to confirm shipments, moving them from CREATED to CONFIRMED status with idempotent retry behavior and proper error handling.\n\nChanged       ApiError.kt — added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE to ErrorCode enum for state conflict errors\n              ShipmentController.kt — added confirm() endpoint at POST /{shipmentId}/confirm\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt — added 4 tests covering all cases (CREATED→CONFIRMED, idempotent, CANCELLED rejection, 404)\n\nTests         Test 1: `confirms a created shipment and moves it to CONFIRMED status` — verifies state transition from CREATED to CONFIRMED, returns 200 OK\n              Test 2: `confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds and changes nothing` — verifies idempotent retry behavior, returns 200 OK unchanged\n              Test 3: `confirms a cancelled shipment is rejected with a conflict error` — verifies 409 Conflict with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE code for invalid state\n              Test 4: `confirms a non-existent shipment is rejected with a not found error` — verifies 404 Not Found with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND code for missing resource\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test from sample-service/\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 17 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 skipped\n\nNot done      Nothing — all acceptance criteria met and verified.\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3334,"cache_read_input_tokens":19917,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3334},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"72d0db4f-0a50-44df-9ae9-d00fd6edf755","uuid":"62cceda6-8501-4278-9c85-46368dbec2fd","timestamp":"2026-09-09T08:01:16.544Z","request_id":"req_011CesWmX4xCBmHBMNo17uDk"}
